            "speaker_id": 139865,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, following our alignment on A1, I've drafted a high-level channel and calendar plan in A3. This covers initial ideas for digital content (T5) and on-site signage (T7). I'd love your feedback on the mix. @178948, especially interested in your thoughts for the launch events.",
