            "speaker_id": 178948,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks for sharing. The calendar in A3 looks like a good starting point. For the events (T3), I propose we run three 'Safety & Sustainability Hub' pop-ups at our main operational sites. They would be interactive, with short demos and a Q&A. This format is engaging and budget-friendly. I've started a draft logistics plan in A5 to capture this.",
