            "speaker_id": 541878,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "The channel mix in A3 seems balanced. A quick thought: let's be mindful of email frequency to avoid tuning out. Could we combine the weekly themes so each message covers safety, security, and sustainability? This would reinforce the integrated nature of the campaign, as per A1.",
            "mentions": [],
