            "speaker_id": 494228,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, to ensure consistency and compliance, I've drafted the Quality Review Checklist (A2) for task T4. I've also mapped out a proposed review workflow for T9. Both are in the linked doc. Please review and provide feedback.",
